entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.placements.name.PlayerIndicatorZone=Player Indicator Zone (Old)
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.mode="Limited mode"：指示器只在该区域内显示\n"Toggle Mode"：只要房间内存在至少一个区域（无论多大），\n作用范围就是整个房间，但只有玩家碰到该区域时图标才会切换\n例如：把区域放在房间范围之外仍然有效，但区域内的开关设置\n无法生效，因为玩家碰不到该区域
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.renderBorder=是否在游戏内渲染该区域的边框
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.renderInside=是否在区域内部渲染一块填充区域
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.continuousLine=渲染的边框使用虚线还是实线
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.flagToggle=该区域如何控制 "flag"
entities.ChroniaHelper/PlayerIndicatorZone.attributes.description.flag=受 "flag mode" 控制的 flag

