entities.ChroniaHelper/OmniZipWater.attributes.description.sideFlag=开启后，zipmover 在检查 "ZipMoverSync:synctag" 时也会检查 flag "synctag"
entities.ChroniaHelper/OmniZipWater.attributes.description.touchSensitive=是否能通过触碰激活该 zipmover（原版需要抓住或站在上面）

